


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_fab03114:


    "——回到现在的时间线，正当午休。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_ebe4dd98:



    voice "2HI_0062"
    hina "「哈，哈，新学期刚开始就迟到……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_1c6ca30e:



    voice "2MI_0015"
    miyako "「……非常抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_447aa951:



    voice "2HI_0063"
    hina "「不是的不是的，并没有责怪圣夜子的意思哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_bdcb964b:



    voice "2FU_0043"
    fumi "「我也是像平时的样子，结果一不注意就发呆了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_ebc0427e:


    "三人互相垂首致歉。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_e6d6ee2b:



    voice "2RI_0059"
    rin "「不过，真是始料未及的伏兵呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_7d2b0bb0:


    "这边，伦事不关己似的从水壶中倒茶出来――"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_3306c8e6:



    voice "2HI_0064"
    hina "「说的好像与己无关一样，伦你不也是差点就迟到了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_2c9e4c6a:



    voice "2RI_0060B"
    rin "「我的生物钟告诉我一切尽在掌握中」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_525b63b4:



    voice "2HI_0065"
    hina "「你赶紧修修你那破钟吧！全都是“伦时制”的错不是吗！就是因为早上的时间全部被伦你框定死了，才会导致像这样无法应对例外事件的嘛！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_77f421f4:



    voice "2RI_0061"
    rin "「系统原因导致的损失让客户来背，这可不好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_7b06d644:



    voice "2HI_0066"
    hina "「闭嘴！全部都是伦的错！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_a_73f02263:



    voice "2FU_0044"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_3e901ef1:



    voice "2HI_0067"
    hina "「真是的。新学期才刚开始就差点迟到」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_d6f9ec8a:



    voice "2RI_0062"
    rin "「勉强赶上了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_7c784bec:



    voice "2HI_0068"
    hina "「幸亏校长先生偶尔会睁一只眼闭一只眼，其实我们已经迟到了的说」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_acf6c5b4:



    voice "2MI_0016"
    miyako "「明天开始我会注意的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_72d15db8:



    voice "2RI_0063"
    rin "「逐渐习惯之后就没问题的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_81c51333:



    voice "2HI_0069"
    hina "「还说逐渐习惯，你都已经持续一整年这样了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_7ed5d99c:



    voice "2FU_0045"
    fumi "「早上那个时间居然遇到校长先生，真是稀奇呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_33a19a82:



    voice "2HI_0070"
    hina "「确实是呢。话说圣夜子，看到你刚才被搭话了，是熟人吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_70217a3b:



    voice "2MI_0017"
    miyako "「并不是，应该是第一次见面」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_7e080925:



    voice "2HI_0071"
    hina "「应该是因为你是转学过来的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_25e1b205:



    voice "2FU_0046"
    fumi "「或许已经在转校资料上见过本人照片了也说不定」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_2716f21f:



    voice "2MI_0018"
    miyako "「啊，话说回来，我忘了从祥子姐那里拿文件了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_ed3595d4:



    voice "2HI_0072"
    hina "「嗯？那怎么办？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_964e1c2e:



    voice "2RI_0064"
    rin "「嘛，毕竟是上了年纪的女人了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_b_cb75a293:



    voice "2FU_0047"
    fumi "「喂，我说你啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_182398fe:



    voice "2FU_0048"
    fumi "「好啦，一起去吃便当吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_e71a1478:



    voice "2RI_0065"
    rin "「大家都有带自己的那一份吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_5ecdb2a7:



    voice "2HI_0073"
    hina "「有哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_61a87ab0:



    voice "2MI_0019"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_47c7f254:



    voice "2FU_0049"
    fumi "「便当好歹是没出问题……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_f8038916:


    "大家各自从包里取出便当后把包装解开。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_658959b7:


    "文的手工便当还是老样子的精致。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_994ffa3d:



    voice "2MI_0020"
    miyako "「哇，好漂亮！居然如此五彩斑斓……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_1ac51eae:


    "刚刚打开盖子，圣夜子就在一旁发出感叹之声。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_60e06c92:



    voice "2MI_0021"
    miyako "「这就像所谓的宝石箱吧，居然每天都会做这样的便当……好厉害！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_6a9c4f64:


    "圣夜子陶醉地望着点缀在文的便当盒中的色彩。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_cd2efeb2:



    voice "2FU_0050"
    fumi "「如此赞扬的话，我会受宠若惊的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_1f5b2200:


    "顺便一提，圣夜子这样的感动并不是头一次了。这样的情景在大家吃饭时少说也重复出现了一周了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_2b29f785:



    voice "2MI_0022"
    miyako "「对，对不起，一不注意就兴奋起来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_8a4ab9df:



    voice "2RI_0066"
    rin "「每次都跟第一次吃饭的时候一样呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_8e04ffca:



    voice "2FU_0051"
    fumi "「哈哈，我也有制作便当的价值了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_55625358:



    voice "2HI_0074"
    hina "「圣夜子，你每次都是先夸赞料理的色彩搭配呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_4cd23524:



    voice "2MI_0023"
    miyako "「是的。虽然味道和气息以及口感也都非常出色，但最先映入眼帘的是料理的颜色」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_f041bd6f:



    voice "2MI_0024"
    miyako "「这个小番茄也很漂亮呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_94152617:


    "一时间，想不起词来。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_27d47e9a:



    voice "2RI_0067"
    rin "「嗯，红色？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_8e26f2c9:



    voice "2MI_0025"
    miyako "「那个，嗯，红色……这就是红色吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_78e75a5f:


    "看到小番茄后，圣夜子连同颜色的名字一同在嘴里嘟哝着。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_e8a0e79f:



    voice "2RI_0068"
    rin "「虽然能流畅对话，但有时也会在奇怪的地方卡住呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_38fad1b4:



    voice "2MI_0026"
    miyako "「我会加油的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_d285dc5b:



    voice "2HI_0075"
    hina "「感觉像是从没有颜色的国家来的人呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_dd90bfdf:



    voice "2MI_0027"
    miyako "「……啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_2965a565:


    "圣夜子果然很敏锐。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_634df5df:


    "圣夜子不是不知道红色这单词，而是不知道什么是红色。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_931922d4:



    voice "2RI_0069"
    rin "「你看你看，鹰冈同学，青椒的绿色也非常漂亮呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_1d82aacc:


    "说着这话的伦，把讨厌吃的青椒夹到了圣夜子的便当盒里。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_03_c_86c070b8:



    voice "2FU_0052B"
    fumi "「喂」"
